    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The presented screenshots do not reflect the finished product; the game is still in development, and this page will be updated with progress.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208230/extras/4e55ae28b60ef2b4e345738ff2b4b68d.avif?t=1730994226\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tyrants came from the stars plunging our world into hoplessnes, now i have become next victim to be exposed to the horrors of their rule, unlike those before me though, I'm ready to do whatever it takes to survive...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have been cast into <strong>dungeons</strong>, mysterious place used by powerful race of star travelers to experiment on all living things. By progressing through you will discover results of this horrific experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208230/extras/b9cb7b242638cbccdc63054c4ca87213.avif?t=1730994226\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skiv is dungeon crawler focused on time and resource management. It features turn based combat which demands good decision making around limited resources where death has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skin carcasses of defeated enemies for valuable body parts which you can use to become stronger but beware of the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System of risk and reward based around managing time and resources, will you take safest path to the end or will you sacrifice current resources for potential rewards?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat demanding strategic use of the limited resources, and bosses with uniqe fighting styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and rich lore waiting to be uncovered and put together.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The presented screenshots do not reflect the finished product; the game is still in development, and this page will be updated with progress.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208230/extras/4e55ae28b60ef2b4e345738ff2b4b68d.avif?t=1730994226\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tyrants came from the stars plunging our world into hoplessnes, now i have become next victim to be exposed to the horrors of their rule, unlike those before me though, I'm ready to do whatever it takes to survive...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have been cast into <strong>dungeons</strong>, mysterious place used by powerful race of star travelers to experiment on all living things. By progressing through you will discover results of this horrific experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208230/extras/b9cb7b242638cbccdc63054c4ca87213.avif?t=1730994226\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skiv is dungeon crawler focused on time and resource management. It features turn based combat which demands good decision making around limited resources where death has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skin carcasses of defeated enemies for valuable body parts which you can use to become stronger but beware of the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System of risk and reward based around managing time and resources, will you take safest path to the end or will you sacrifice current resources for potential rewards?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat demanding strategic use of the limited resources, and bosses with uniqe fighting styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and rich lore waiting to be uncovered and put together.</p></li></ul>",
